{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgkw6YH7gbuLdtbEw6nWn","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'd open a securities account at פסגות and buy \"אי.בי.אי. מחקה (4A) ת\"א 125\". The page puts it at 86,045 ₪ after 10 years. That's for 10,000 ₪ now plus 500 ₪ a month, which is the page's example, not my own money. I'm fairly sure about the choice, less sure about the number.\n\n**What decided it:** The first screen already picks for me. \"פסגות\", \"הזול\", star, 86,045 ₪. Further down there's a line saying \"הכי הרבה בכל המחירונים: 86,045 ₪, אי.בי.אי. מחקה ת\"א 125, פסגות\". The page says it doesn't recommend an index, but it clearly does recommend the account and the fund. Also, the next option was 85,015 with a \"−1,030 ₪\", and the minus put me off it.\n\n**Where I looked, in order:**\n1. Big heading \"איפה ואיך הכי זול להשקיע במדד\". ת\"א-125 was already picked.\n2. The amount boxes: \"סכום היום\" 10,000, \"הפקדה חודשית\" 500, \"תשואה בשנה\" 7%. That's where my 30,000 and few hundred a month should go. These were screenshots, so I couldn't type in them. The 86,045 is for their example.\n3. The big numbers: \"הפקדתם 70,000 ₪\", then 86,045 against 85,015.\n4. The colour bar and legend, which I skimmed.\n5. The list of accounts. פסגות was first, then לאומי, וואן זירו, הבינלאומי and so on down to מיטב טרייד at about 63,000. I skipped all the \"לא בחישוב\" notes and both \"אין נתון\" ones.\n6. The fund box: \"דמי ניהול 0.1%\" and \"נאמן 0.025%\". I skipped those.\n7. The fund list. Mine is the \"קרן מחקה\" one at \"−0.04%\". The rest are \"קרן סל\" with bigger minuses and −1,030 to −1,733 ₪.\n8. I skimmed the chart with lines for שנים / הפקדה חודשית etc. and didn't use it.\n9. The steps chart and the line confirming 86,045. I stopped there and didn't open screens 12–13.\n\n**Words I didn't get:** דמי משמרת, נאמן, \"(4A)\", \"קרן סל\" vs \"קרן מחקה\", \"העמלות זו על זו\", \"מול המדד\", \"בכסף של היום\", \"הפסד נחתך\".\n\n**What bothered me:**\n- The \"−0.04%\" on the fund I'm choosing. I don't know what that minus means, and it scared me a bit.\n- I couldn't put in my own 30,000, so I don't know what I'd actually end up with.\n- \"−1,030 ₪\" sits right under 85,015. At first I read it as money I'd lose.\n- The 7% is just \"לדוגמה של האתר\". So is the 86,045 a promise or a guess?\n- פסגות vs. my own bank: is it worth opening a new account somewhere I don't know for about 3,000 ₪ more?\n- The tax section says \"המס 342 ₪ יותר\". Paying more tax counts as good?\n- Dotted underlines under all the numbers, and I never knew what they're for.\n- I got bored around the chart with four lines and nearly closed the page there."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3670,"cache_read_input_tokens":21115,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3670},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bd7a3fec-2849-42ff-95cc-6f6fe1eb1aa6","uuid":"1290c70d-0f67-4098-8ee1-d2a727920507","timestamp":"2026-11-06T03:05:02.061Z","request_id":"req_011Cgkw6XrZv94wXDg1MywPF"}
